  (text "EC MODULE-DETECTION + PULL-UPS (330k IDs work per forum t/74018 OP; other values from MXM 3.1, the FW16 interface schematic and the community board)" (at 39.37 448.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "39c102ab-077d-4683-af7b-e6ada4222f6c"))
(text "PWR_LEVEL: battery -> reduced card power (GPIO2_EC = AC present)" (at 340.36 502.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "a3f286df-b409-496a-9087-a780b89ddcc1"))
(text "EEPROM: blank = EC defaults to dual-SSD (x4x2) and never enables VSYS. Program PCIE_THERMAL_3RDPARTY (PCIE_8X1, VSYS_EN, FAN_EN, 3V_5V_EN, F75303 @0x4D)," (at 39.37 490.22 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "351a637a-c4d4-46ac-bc68-e66473a70643"))
(text "but set GPU_PCIE_MUX_SEL LOW so DP_A AUX is not rerouted to SSD2 CLK. Note: EC sets GPU_PRESENT (eDP mux path) only for vendor GPU_AMD_R23M." (at 39.37 494.03 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "65eb8b36-f5f6-448a-b106-8ff241417f39"))
(text "POWER: VSYS -> TVS D1 -> eFuse U1 (TPS25982, ~9.9 A limit) -> PWR_SRC to the MXM card; +5V / +3V3 from host 5V_ALW (2.5A max) / 3V3_ALW (2.0A max)" (at 39.37 519.43 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "e7a776a2-d59f-4d67-b413-bcb89b71502e"))
(text "J2 POWER INTERPOSER (pinout: FrameworkComputer/ExpansionBay)" (at 439.42 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "44cdd720-d447-4570-b04f-d0ea30298a88"))
(text "PWR_EN: 1.8 V host GPIO AND eFuse PG -> 3.3 V card PWR_EN" (at 304.8 595.63 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "f4d3554c-d7c4-4f76-bdcd-38e7a06432bb"))
(text "FAN HEADERS - host EC drives 12V_FAN / PWM (5 V) and reads SPEED (5 V OD). Pinout per FW ref PCB drawing." (at 560.07 66.04 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "c4a2d08c-39e1-4ccc-a16c-09c7e14602b8"))
(text "FAN-CONTROL TEMP SENSOR - F75303 @0x4D on the ALW I2C bus (Framework PCIE_THERMAL_3RDPARTY descriptor). Pins per FW16 7040 interface schematic p.9." (at 420.37 448.31 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "7a717488-a3e4-49f3-b740-fb4ef312b38f"))
(text "FW16 EXPANSION BAY -> MXM 3.x ADAPTER  |  schematic v4 DRAFT  |  generated + ERC-checked with KiCad 10 (kicad-cli)" (at 10.16 11.43 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "d33959bc-be27-48d3-8719-70565695d3e5"))
(text "NOT A MANUFACTURABLE DESIGN. No PCB layout. Every value/pin/footprint marked TBD is an unresolved placeholder (see BOM CSV)." (at 10.16 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "39c9d247-d912-4e7d-a310-3b65a441865f"))
